{"id": "3116199", "revid": "16377639", "url": "https://ro.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3116199", "title": "\u0428", "text": "\u0428 (\u0428, \u0448) este o liter\u0103 a alfabetului chirilic. Corespondentul s\u0103u \u00een limba rom\u00e2n\u0103 este \u0218 (\u0218, \u0219), adic\u0103 consoana fricativ\u0103 postalveolar\u0103 surd\u0103 /\u0283/.\nLitera este romanizat\u0103 \u27e8sh\u27e9 sau \u27e8\u0161\u27e9."}
